MV Animations were added to the MZ engine with a later update, they were not available from the beginning.
If you do not have the option "MV compatible data" on right-click, that means your editor is too old and needs to be updated to gain that option. And then you also need to update your project because without the updated code the game engine doesn't know how to use MV animations either
